# eol=lf for EVERYTHING text: `git archive` applies eol conversion at archive
# time, so with core.autocrlf=true on Windows an artifact built here shipped
# CRLF in every .py/.yaml entry while only .sh and the pre-commit were pinned.
# LF everywhere makes the archive byte-identical across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
privacy-hook/pre-commit text eol=lf
